WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Type your shop name — watch the address update.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Paste your key from console.getsolari.com → API Keys → Create → Copy.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Hit Validate — you'll see "Ready — key valid."

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Hit Launch — your site goes live, inbox ready.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Open the shop — take quotes. One key, one click.
